app.faq.connectai.a:
On the panel, open the "Connect my AI" section:
- pick the token's role (never above yours) and its validity (30 days by default, 90 at most) and click "Create token";
- copy the token right away: it is not shown again. Keep it out of git, in the TRADVIA_TOKEN variable or your client's vault;
- set up the Tradvia MCP server in your client with the snippet the section shows: local MCP (the tradvia mcp command) or MCP over HTTP with the Authorization: Bearer header;
- ask the AI to follow the repository's AGENTS.md.
The AI then reads the project briefing, takes a free card, works on branch tradvia/issue-N and opens a PR with Closes #N.
